{"parse":{"title":"个性/血色之怒","pageid":4782,"revid":12204,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E8%A1%80%E8%89%B2%E4%B9%8B%E6%80%92&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E8%A1%80%E8%89%B2%E4%B9%8B%E6%80%92&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E8%A1%80%E8%89%B2%E4%B9%8B%E6%80%92&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>血色之怒</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E8.A1.80.E8.89.B2.E4.B9.8B.E6.80.92\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"血色之怒\"><b>血色之怒</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">个性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"个性 血色之怒.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/47/r1yau0cd5beoyndwv9jr72bt5x76bsq.png/80px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E8%A1%80%E8%89%B2%E4%B9%8B%E6%80%92.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/47/r1yau0cd5beoyndwv9jr72bt5x76bsq.png/120px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E8%A1%80%E8%89%B2%E4%B9%8B%E6%80%92.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/47/r1yau0cd5beoyndwv9jr72bt5x76bsq.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />血色之怒\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>攻击前，若目标拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"护盾\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">护盾</font></span></span>]，则自身伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>，并驱散<font color=\"#ed7950\">6</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"护盾\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">护盾</font></span></span>]。造成[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">范围伤害</span>]时，造成的物理伤害视为魔法伤害。战斗开始时，自身额外拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">血色之怒</font></span>]，使用后进入[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"暴走状态\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">暴走状态</font></span></span>]，每场战斗最多使用<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次。<br />释放[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">血色之怒</span>]后，触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"无限不屈\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">无限不屈</font></span></span>]，持续至下回合行动开始前。[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"暴走状态\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">暴走状态</font></span></span>]可持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br /><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%BF%A0%E6%96%AF%E5%9D%A6\" title=\"角色图鉴库/翠斯坦\"><img alt=\"头像 翠斯坦.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/f/f8/qxmiscgs2hzov40skvj0pwby5pcs8hf.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">翠斯坦</font></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>攻击前，若目标拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"护盾\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">护盾</font></span></span>]，则自身伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>，并驱散<font color=\"#ed7950\">6</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"护盾\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">护盾</font></span></span>]。造成[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">范围伤害</span>]时，造成的物理伤害视为魔法伤害。战斗开始时，自身额外拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">血色之怒</font></span>]，使用后进入[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"暴走状态\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">暴走状态</font></span></span>]，每场战斗最多使用<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次。<br />释放[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">血色之怒</span>]后，触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"无限不屈\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">无限不屈</font></span></span>]，持续至下回合行动开始前。[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"暴走状态\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">暴走状态</font></span></span>]可持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合，期间暴击率、暴击伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>攻击前，若目标拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"护盾\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">护盾</font></span></span>]，则自身伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>，并驱散<font color=\"#ed7950\">6</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"护盾\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">护盾</font></span></span>]。造成[<span style=\"display:inline;whit